<title>CANADA: Parkland Q2 Dec 31 shr net turns to loss.</title>
<headline>Parkland Q2 Dec 31 shr net turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>RED DEER, Alberta 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	C$0.04   profit	C$0.58</p>
<p> Net	   loss	   232   profit	 3,700</p>
<p> Cash flow/shr		nil		     0.30</p>
<p> Revs			55,700		   41,100</p>
<p>	    6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	C$0.03   profit	C$0.78</p>
<p> Net	 profit	   178   profit	 4,900</p>
<p> Cash flow/shr	     0.31		     0.70</p>
<p> Revs		     115,800		   84,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Parkland Industries Ltd. Second-quarter 1997 results included a gain on sale of investments of C$1.2 million after tax resulting from the disposition of 400,000 shares of Crestar Energy Inc. Second-quarter 1996 results included a gain on the sale of investments of C$3.2 million after tax from the disposition of Parkland's remaining shares in Ensign Resource Services Group Inc.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
